<description><![CDATA[<img alt="Wisconsin women's golf outing 2025" src="https://uwbadgers.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/6/3/c26ef4b0-5368-49a4-a594-64aa2d2727bbWBB-20250804-GOLF_OUTING-BYLIN-108.jpg" /><br /><br />Sign up today for your first chance to meet the 2026-27 Wisconsin women's basketball team when the Badgers host the 31st-annual Wisconsin Women's Basketball Golf Outing on Monday, August 3 at University Ridge Golf Course. Fans and attendees will be able to interact and have pictures taken with members of the team, coaches and staff while enjoying a day on the links with a dinner and auction to follow.]]></description>
